======================================================================
OPEN AI STATEMENT & POLICY
======================================================================
Unlike upstream yt-dlp which explicitly prohibits the use of Artificial
Intelligence in development, the js_ydlp project OPENLY SUPPORTS,
WELCOMES, AND EMBRACES the use of Artificial Intelligence (AI), Machine
Learning models, Large Language Models (LLMs), and automated coding agents
in its architectural design, source code generation, refactoring,
debugging, documentation, and maintenance.

We believe AI-assisted pair programming and agentic workflows represent
a revolutionary advancement in software engineering, enabling superior
code clarity, higher performance, comprehensive testing, and rapid evolution.
Contributions created with or assisted by AI are first-class citizens in
this project.
